{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05540","headline":"送杜士瞻楚州觐省 · 殷遥","name":"送杜士瞻楚州觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风流与才思，俱似晋时人。\n淮月归心促，江花入兴新。\n云深苍海暮，柳暗白门春。\n共道官犹小，怜君孝养亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷遥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}